{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>\u2022 Feeling Tired? \u2022</u></h2><br>Trash Bomber is a relaxing <strong>&quot;hidden object&quot;</strong> game, suitable for people of all ages!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067760/extras/82be73b073e99d792db586f34759a3a6.poster.avif?t=1752696892\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067760/extras/82be73b073e99d792db586f34759a3a6.webm?t=1752696892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067760/extras/82be73b073e99d792db586f34759a3a6.mp4?t=1752696892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>\u2022 Gameplay \u2022</u></h2><br>You are tasked with overseeing the process of turning trash into ashes inside an incinerator. Due to poor sorting, each batch of garbage that's poured into this machine comes with objects that aren't allowed to be recycled in it. Your job is simple: find every object that can't be incinerated (represented by the icon in the middle of the screen) and <strong>blow them up</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067760/extras/29484534a36f9e39e1884914d652b006.poster.avif?t=1752696892\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067760/extras/29484534a36f9e39e1884914d652b006.webm?t=1752696892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067760/extras/29484534a36f9e39e1884914d652b006.mp4?t=1752696892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>\u2022 Endless Supply of Puzzles! \u2022</u></h2><br>Since there's no way to know <strong>what</strong> people will throw into their garbage bins, every heap of trash is randomly generated based on the chosen difficulty.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067760/extras/e0be360a6289020b2d8a5398022a3fbb.poster.avif?t=1752696892\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067760/extras/e0be360a6289020b2d8a5398022a3fbb.webm?t=1752696892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067760/extras/e0be360a6289020b2d8a5398022a3fbb.mp4?t=1752696892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>\u2022 Customize the Incinerator! \u2022</u></h2><br>The more piles of trash you successfully inspect and burn down, the more <strong>color palettes</strong> will be available for you to decorate the incinerator with!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067760/extras/ecec91884e2d36c1bca17b96d1df04c8.poster.avif?t=1752696892\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067760/extras/ecec91884e2d36c1bca17b96d1df04c8.webm?t=1752696892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Pinch of Trash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2067760/3c559261d9f99a85cd0d168769bcb485f50c5577.jpg"},{"name":"A Spoon of Trash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2067760/2590ac1583b17b758d65dae32b45928e380c8a52.jpg"},{"name":"A Cup of Trash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2067760/c0d2b0aaf7f9507f5d882d54d700b7e193195fa2.jpg"},{"n